# Enterprise Features & Compliance

## Enterprise Architecture
This portfolio dashboard is designed as an enterprise-grade application with the following key features:

### Core Enterprise Features
- **API Gateway**: Centralized API management and routing
- **Audit Logging**: Comprehensive logging of all user actions and system events
- **Compliance Reporting**: Automated reporting for regulatory compliance
- **Data Governance**: Data quality, lineage, and privacy controls
- **Enterprise Authentication**: Multi-factor authentication and SSO integration
- **Role-Based Access Control**: Granular permissions and access management
- **SSO Integration**: Single sign-on with enterprise identity providers

### Security Requirements
- Implement proper authentication and authorization
- Use JWT tokens with appropriate expiration
- Implement rate limiting and DDoS protection
- Encrypt sensitive data at rest and in transit
- Follow OWASP security guidelines
- Implement proper session management

### Data Governance
- Implement data quality checks
- Maintain data lineage tracking
- Ensure data privacy compliance
- Implement data retention policies
- Use proper data classification

### Compliance Considerations
- Audit all user actions and system changes
- Implement proper logging and monitoring
- Ensure data integrity and availability
- Follow industry-specific compliance requirements
- Implement proper backup and recovery procedures

### Performance & Scalability
- Design for horizontal scaling
- Implement proper caching strategies
- Use database connection pooling
- Monitor performance metrics
- Implement proper load balancing

### Monitoring & Observability
- Implement comprehensive logging
- Use application performance monitoring
- Set up alerting for critical issues
- Monitor system health and availability
- Track business metrics and KPIs

### Integration Requirements
- Design APIs for external system integration
- Implement proper error handling and retry logic
- Use message queues for asynchronous processing
- Implement proper API versioning
- Ensure backward compatibility

### Deployment & Operations
- Use containerization for consistent deployments
- Implement proper CI/CD pipelines
- Use infrastructure as code
- Implement proper environment management
- Ensure high availability and disaster recovery